{"title":"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be TNYWR.<br />\nThe average of the list of five numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/beb205166f3a4a815b890bb6a4e402ce64a34349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13\\text{, }16\\text{, }10\\text{, }15\\text{, }11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /><br />\nThe average of the list of four numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92c24bffd068d0fa4d1d74dbc6f863002701902e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16\\text{, }t\\text{, }3\\text{, }13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /><br />\nWhat is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39dd48954afea6461cb5f99e7d4d0cfb274cdc52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m - n$\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, the sum of the numbers that have an average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45a63b71797851e471ae11f00179a9f52143b4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 + 16 + 10 + 15 + 11 = 29 + 25 + 11 = 65$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"347\" height=\"15\" />. There are also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of these numbers, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b572c386f9e3ed6ad3a05be678b29cf0036d049d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\frac{65}{5} = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"107\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Next, the sum of the numbers that have an average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/2/0327837a43ee7f22c98de5a1aba5c3b7f6ae893f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 + t + 3 + 13 = t + 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"192\" height=\"15\" />. There are also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of these numbers, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/6136c9a71eb43da72062285ebc906c13807ce797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{32 + t}{4} = 8 + \\frac{t}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43bd47437fcfb3ef1dd71dfad3088015d0c27577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" /> from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem A\">seat A</a>, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/a/11a3683b9614fdaae8412df2302f030e15ca2e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 8 + \\frac{4}{4} = 8 + 1 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The difference of the averages is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/500254e0d858d28d01e725a545186876ff21359e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m - n = 13 - 9 = \\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC\">2014 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem A\">Relay 0 Problem A</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Prob